{"name": "We Gotta Go", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends are stuck in a haunted mansion and desperately need to find the bathroom. Your goal: navigate the haunted halls and survive ghostly encounters to reach the porcelain promised land to escape before your bowels betray you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/273e9f521c863adebc7a7b0113cc9f99.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/273e9f521c863adebc7a7b0113cc9f99.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/273e9f521c863adebc7a7b0113cc9f99.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/3193c62fa0f3972c424a61eb8cca1e20.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"500\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fear, stress, and bad burritos all push your gut closer to disaster. Manage your bowels carefully - make better food choices, fart to relieve the pressure, and more, all before you become a pile of poo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/a598db12f8e4bdd75a68bfafe9b36ede.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/a598db12f8e4bdd75a68bfafe9b36ede.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/a598db12f8e4bdd75a68bfafe9b36ede.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/600e6d2ce7ff8e169a75ddae349cc0ee.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"500\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TP Mummies, turd mobs and a host of other horrors lurk in the darkness, waiting to scare your pants off. Literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/e4a7be3faaa7205ee8345ca70c0f8b4c.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/e4a7be3faaa7205ee8345ca70c0f8b4c.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/e4a7be3faaa7205ee8345ca70c0f8b4c.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/0e6b2d806d1d99e1a16a54fdc9be9702.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light up lanterns, wield wonky weapons, and fling fancy furniture to break open doors, solve haunted puzzles, and keep ghosts at bay (or just throw s#!t at your friends).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/09706defb9a9d57dc4a240f20eb35d83.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/09706defb9a9d57dc4a240f20eb35d83.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/09706defb9a9d57dc4a240f20eb35d83.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/41c023f5d06a290f25101712642c9032.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"500\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge clothes from corpses to mix up your style. Then die, and return as a playable poop, only to be reborn again with an even better fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/90f430c955c455584d839d961761dbfc.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/90f430c955c455584d839d961761dbfc.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/90f430c955c455584d839d961761dbfc.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/d479e99f517fc814a7f4687a3adfabf1.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The procedurally generated mansion won\u2019t make it easy: its many passages are blocked, locked, hidden, and haunted... Can your team survive and extract via the porcelain throne?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/55c3cebbe3d13e5925fc9c2b0f31184c.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/55c3cebbe3d13e5925fc9c2b0f31184c.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/55c3cebbe3d13e5925fc9c2b0f31184c.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "We Gotta Go is a co-op horror comedy that\u2019ll scare the crap out of you\u2014literally. Team up to reach the only bathroom in a haunted mansion before your bowels betray you. Scavenge for items, fend off ghosts, and fight through cursed halls together in a desperate hunt for sweet relief.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/3387eeb71a61ecb79ad07cfd5710ae28a2bdd1f8/header.jpg?t=1778866613", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Online Co-Op", "Comedy", "Funny", "Indie", "Horror", "First-Person"], "developers": "FuzzyBot", "publishers": "FuzzyBot", "release_date": "Apr 14, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "3967470", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "30 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/_7NbCNERFKM", "first_seen": 1769727600.0, "review_rank": 1294}